Emerging from the shadows, the eccentric merchant from earlier walked with confidence towards the pair with a troublesome grin. Dressed in the same outfit from earlier, the coal stains that had ruined her clothes were now mysteriously gone. 
{$redFlagName}: “I apologize for overhearing your conversation, but I can only wait for so long to use that board behind you.”
<<cs 3 4>>
{$bestFriendName}: “{$playerName}, who is this person?”
<<MC true>>
