Exchanging goodbyes, you wave to Maeve as she exits the room with an anxious look on her face. You wonder what could be upsetting her so dearly.
<<destroy 3>>
<<cs 1 1>>
{$mentorName}: “By the gods, how did you get so popular already? Most apprentices take months if not years to find someone worth their time, but it looks like you already found yourself some worthwhile options.”
