{$mentorName}: “And that friend of yours, Maeve, might not have much fame now, but I recognize that sword of hers. If she inherited that from whom I think, then she will be a worthy commissioner in her future endeavors.”
You nod along with your senior, finding his observations to be logically sound. Although the benefits of each commissioner were apparent, you can’t help but feel like you’re missing something.
