title: resourcegameGood
---
........ //for some reason this node starts on line 2
<<cs 0 1>>
<<MC true>>
{$playerName}: “I say it went fairly well. Got myself a good supply.”
<<cs 1 1>>
{$mentorName}: “Thank the gods. Nice work, rookie.”
<<destroy 1>>
<<MC false>>
The departure from the mines in triumph fills you with renewed confidence and excitement. Led back to the carriage, you can’t wait to see how the Pleiotium you harvested will turn out. 
With no need to stay any longer in the village of Pleioridge, you depart back to the Capital with Isham.
Your good work has rewarded you with an open schedule. With no overtime needed, you return to the Capital with extra free time ready to be spent.
<<set $weekOneResult = 2>>
<<jump WeekTwoInteractions>>
