title: resourcegameMediocre
---
........ //for some reason this node starts on line 2
<<cs 0 0>>
<<MC true>>
{$playerName}: “It was okay. I could’ve done better.”
{$mentorName}: “That’s alright, you don’t always get it right the first time. Just make sure to learn from this experience and do better the next time you come.”
<<destroy 1>>
<<MC false>>
The departure from the mines leaves you in deep contemplation, wondering how you could improve your technique. Led back to a hut reserved for visiting blacksmiths, you go to sleep early to prepare for tomorrow. 
Having to work longer than you wish, your return to the capital was delayed by a few more days.
When it was finally time to leave the village, you couldn’t help but wonder how open your schedule would have been if you had done it right the first time.
