-> None of Them
<<else>>
Unfortunately, working overtime at the mines has reduced the amount of time you have left in the day.
<<endif>>
<<change_background "black background">>
After a long day full of important decisions, you finally can return back to home.
The end of the weekend passes by. Tomorrow will be the start of a new week. It will be the start of your smithing work, and perhaps a new week full of decisions to make.
A decision on your commissioner will be made after this week. You hope you are ready for it when the time comes.
<<jump preSmeltingWeekThree>>
===

title: preSmeltingWeekThree
---
<<change_background "entrance hall">>
You enter the guild ready to begin the next important step of your journey as an apprentice. Smelting the Pleiotium ore that you harvested. 
Once you are done with this step, you will have to decide on the commission you wish to take before you can begin shaping the metal. 
<<change_background "personal forge">>
Entering your forge, you load the coal once more into your cauldron, lighting the flames that will be necessary to begin your work. 
Isham checks in now and then, offering advice when you need it. But he never sticks around long, not wanting to interrupt your focus while you prepare your forge.
Then the time finally comes, and your preparations are completed. The smelting can begin.
<<run_minigame 2 postSmeltingWeekThree>>
