<<destroy 1>>
Leaving the forge, you make your way across the hallway towards where Judith is awaiting your meeting.
<<change_background "commissions room daytime">>
<<sp 2>>
{$redFlagName}: “Congratulations, dear, I heard you have successfully completed smelting your ore. Have you considered my request?”
<<MC true>>
<<cs 0 2>>
