//<<change_background "capital streets">>
Walking back to your home, you notice someone standing outside your home with a large pole in their hands. 
Cautiously, you approach the strange person, ready to run if anything looks off. But all you were met with was the spaced-out look of your friend, Maeve, as she stood waiting for you.
<<sp 3>>
<<MC true>>
